                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cd84d659-e15e-3b58-b0cd-31533024c8df",
                        "entry_id": "734e25cd-73fc-3132-aabf-8a7a53f6bc3c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "физ. имеющий неодинаковые физические свойства по отношению к каким-либо воздействиям в зависимости от направления этих воздействий в пространстве"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d0f448a9-d2d9-4202-8a5a-a07e33610c0b",
                                "sense_id": "cd84d659-e15e-3b58-b0cd-31533024c8df",
                                "text": "В зонах таких напряжений оптически изотропный кристалл становится анизотропным и поляризованный луч света разделяется на два луча."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "992c42ad-5395-4090-97fd-f9c03c29c477",
                        "source_entry_id": "734e25cd-73fc-3132-aabf-8a7a53f6bc3c",
                        "source_sense_id": "cd84d659-e15e-3b58-b0cd-31533024c8df",
                        "target_lang_word": "aeolotropic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "aeolotropic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0c6b7bf3-1b8c-3dce-9480-2811026a92d9",
                                        "entry_id": "9179a67c-41cf-344e-bbe2-73329f5b1c6b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to aeolotropy; of a body or substance, having physical properties (e.g., electric conductivity, refractive index) that depend on the direction in which they are measured."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ec0ad89-d8c9-47c1-bbeb-c02153bc2015",
                                                "sense_id": "0c6b7bf3-1b8c-3dce-9480-2811026a92d9",
                                                "text": "An individual body […] may be isotropic in one quality or class of qualities, but æolotropic in others."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ceda17b3-26ac-4103-9720-4150d2f6e450",
                                                "sense_id": "0c6b7bf3-1b8c-3dce-9480-2811026a92d9",
                                                "text": "On extending his [Mitscherlich's] inquiry to other aelotropic crystals he observed a similar variation, and was thus led, in 1825, to the discovery that aelotropic crystals, when heated, expand unequally in the direction of dissimilar axes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f1d6d06f-c63d-4138-b514-f460dfb83671",
                        "source_entry_id": "734e25cd-73fc-3132-aabf-8a7a53f6bc3c",
                        "source_sense_id": "cd84d659-e15e-3b58-b0cd-31533024c8df",
                        "target_lang_word": "anisotropic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "anisotropic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d6c94be9-1728-367a-b731-af0aed30e656",
                                        "entry_id": "b9b2d6e8-6310-3e31-8384-611ea37f8a8d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having properties that differ according to the direction of measurement; exhibiting anisotropy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27062907-c540-41a5-ac96-f021d5db139b",
                                                "sense_id": "d6c94be9-1728-367a-b731-af0aed30e656",
                                                "text": "The crystal has an anisotropic structure, as it is stronger along its length than laterally."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "285ed0a6-e963-4f54-b3ed-8a2bf6b296d3",
                                                "sense_id": "d6c94be9-1728-367a-b731-af0aed30e656",
                                                "text": "The obtained low and anisotropic thermal conductivity, and feasibility of synthesis, in addition to other reports on high electron mobility, make arsenene a promising material for a variety of applications, including thermal management and thermoelectric devices.."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f0f99f96-cfe8-4622-bdd2-61245ce44177",
                        "source_entry_id": "734e25cd-73fc-3132-aabf-8a7a53f6bc3c",
                        "source_sense_id": "cd84d659-e15e-3b58-b0cd-31533024c8df",
